              "worked": "List unordered pairs by their sum:\n\nSum $5$: $(1,4),(2,3)$.\n\nSum $10$: $(1,9),(2,8),(3,7),(4,6)$.\n\nSum $15$: $(6,9),(7,8)$.\n\nThere are $2+4+2=8$ pairs.",
